{"id":"k8owz8rluq29g1l5mugg05l5r","title":"动画：纳米尺度二次离子质谱（NanoSIMS）","originalTitle":null,"summary":"NanoSIMS 通过逐点扫描样品表面，重建每个位置的离子信号图像，观察元素和同位素在微区的分布。一次离子束轰击样品，提取二次离子，通过双聚焦质量分析器区分不同离子，记录并重建图像。不同基体影响二次离子产率，定量分析需校准。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3549522&do=blog&id=1560932"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T10:38:37.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T15:10:22.281Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T15:10:22.281Z","category":"ai-frontier","tags":["论文发表"],"score":28,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"53fa424f-102b-4ed5-b694-e3ee347b784b","title":"NanoSIMS 工作原理解析与实验条件说明"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"53fa424f-102b-4ed5-b694-e3ee347b784b","title":"NanoSIMS 工作原理解析与实验条件说明"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fSQEP3k2xXEQ","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}